; frost_wreck_hold.room - Porao do Naufragio (interior, design 04 sections 3.3 and 4; WORLD-35 step 6): the hold of the
; ship wrecked on frost_shore, listing up to its bow in the east. Three runs of floor (stand rows 8, 7, 6) under a deck
; that lists with them (6 rows of air each, 192 px: a full jump, 143 px rise plus the 54 px capsule, meets the beams by 5 px); two loose deck planks (rows 5 and 4) climb
; to the bow, where the reward slot (`$`) holds the letter's place. The deck rises at col 11, over the middle plank's
; east end, so the hop to the bow plank clears it by 42 px (under the row-1 deck it clears it by 10). No gate: base kit.
; Indoors: the frost edge's wreck planks (`%`, `-`) with void (`_`) outside the hull; no season (systems/seasonal-art).

